WEBVTT

00:00:59.076 --> 00:01:00.716
which means thirsty.

00:01:01.116 --> 00:01:04.516
And it has been called so
for the lack of water resources

00:01:04.556 --> 00:01:05.956
in that area.

00:01:05.996 --> 00:01:09.156
And so the name
of our IDP camp is Otash camp.

00:01:09.676 --> 00:01:11.596
Same name, same issue.

00:01:12.516 --> 00:01:16.516
It's home to almost 100,000 people
from different villages.

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.756
I was very young when we left our home,

00:01:19.796 --> 00:01:23.596
but I can remember the fear
on my family's face

00:01:23.596 --> 00:01:26.676
as they're getting ready,
leaving everything behind.

00:01:26.676 --> 00:01:29.796
I could see their pain,
especially on my mother's face.